an (like \"X deficiency syndrome\"). I'm checking this stays consistent with the SpecificDisease definition without introducing a Gene/Protein label that doesn't exist in the schema, then settling on a moderate-length writeup.\n\n", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "- **Privative-State Disease Span Rule:**\n  - **IF** a nominal phrase contains (a) a privative state noun, meaning a noun denoting absence, lack, or insufficiency of a function (e.g., *deficiency*, *absence*, *lack*, *deficient activity*); (b) a prepositional complement introduced by a locative or genitive preposition (e.g., *of*, *in*), with an optional internal determiner, whose object names a specific biomolecule such as a gene product, enzyme, protein, or complement component, optionally with ordinal or descriptive modifiers; and (c) the surrounding context frames that state as a patient condition, clinical presentation, or cause of disease (e.g., *patients*, *presenting as*, *caused by*, *responsible for*),\n  - **THEN** label the full nominal span, from the privative head through the end of the biomolecule complement, as **SpecificDisease**. Leave the biomolecule name, its abbreviations, and any parenthetical acronyms as O. Exclude pre-head intensifiers and pre-head nouns (e.g., *complete*, or *enzyme* in \"enzyme deficiency in X\").\n  - **Negative Constraint:** Do NOT apply this rule when:\n    - the state noun is not privative (e.g., *reduction*, *increase*, *level*, *activity*) or quantifies a measurement;\n    - the context describes an in vitro, assay, or mechanistic finding rather than a clinical condition;\n    - the complement names a disease, phenotype, pathogen, or non-biomolecular entity, since those cases belong to lexicalized disease heads or other classes;\n    - the same span is already covered by a lexicalized disease head, to avoid duplicate labeling;\n    - the biomolecule is the sole focus with no privative head (in that case it remains O, because the schema has no Gene/Protein class).", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2454, "output_tokens": 2351, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 1728}, "service_tier": "batch", "speed": "standard"}}}